node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
*.log
.DS_Store
.idea/
# a developer's own local pointer at some docs repo, made by hand and never
# meant to be shared. ANCHORED: an unanchored `loam.json` matches that name at
# any depth, which silently swallowed meta/loam.json and meta/docs/loam.json —
# the committed self-model's own config — so `git add` reported nothing and the
# axis could not be landed at all. That anchoring is also what lets
# examples/docs/loam.json be committed, so the shipped example fleet runs from
# a clone with no throwaway file anywhere. Only the ROOT one is disposable.
/loam.json
# per-machine tool permissions, not project configuration — the agents/ and
# skills/ beside it ARE shared, which is why this is excluded by name
.claude/settings.local.json
# agent worktrees: real `git worktree` checkouts of this repository, created
# inside it by parallel agent runs. Committing one would nest a checkout in
# the history; `git worktree list` is where they are managed from.
.claude/worktrees/
